<button class="w-full p-property-minimalist-space-lg flex items-center justify-between text-left gap-property-minimalist-space-md" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
<span class="font-property-minimalist-title-md text-property-minimalist-title-md text-property-minimalist-primary font-bold">What is the exact legal title status and deed issuance timeline?</span>
<span class="faq-icon material-symbols-outlined text-property-minimalist-secondary transition-transform duration-300">expand_more</span>
</button>
<div class="faq-answer max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 px-property-minimalist-space-lg">
<p class="font-property-minimalist-body-md text-property-minimalist-body-md text-property-minimalist-on-surface-variant pb-property-minimalist-space-lg">Every residence in The Denim Horizon Precinct holds pre-split freehold ownership (Sertifikat Hak Milik / SHM) and an approved building consent (Persetujuan Bangunan Gedung / PBG). Upon down payment completion and KPR approval, signing of the Deed of Sale and Purchase (AJB) proceeds directly before an authorized notary without delay.</p>
</div>
</div>
<!-- FAQ 2 -->
<div class="faq-item bg-property-minimalist-surface-container-lowest rounded-property-minimalist-xl shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
<button class="w-full p-property-minimalist-space-lg flex items-center justify-between text-left gap-property-minimalist-space-md" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
<span class="font-property-minimalist-title-md text-property-minimalist-title-md text-property-minimalist-primary font-bold">What smart home features are included and how long is the warranty?</span>
<span class="faq-icon material-symbols-outlined text-property-minimalist-secondary transition-transform duration-300">expand_more</span>
</button>
<div class="faq-answer max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 px-property-minimalist-space-lg">
<p class="font-property-minimalist-body-md text-property-minimalist-body-md text-property-minimalist-on-surface-variant pb-property-minimalist-space-lg">Standard delivery includes a Zigbee central hub, biometric smart digital door lock (passcode, fingerprint, RF card, physical fail-safe key), two outdoor PTZ infrared security cameras, smart lighting switches in the living salon, and an integrated real-time household electrical energy consumption monitor. All electronic subsystems carry a full 2-year developer replacement warranty.</p>
</div>
</div>
<!-- FAQ 3 -->
<div class="faq-item bg-property-minimalist-surface-container-lowest rounded-property-minimalist-xl shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
<button class="w-full p-property-minimalist-space-lg flex items-center justify-between text-left gap-property-minimalist-space-md" onclick="toggleFaq(this)">
<span class="font-property-minimalist-title-md text-property-minimalist-title-md text-property-minimalist-primary font-bold">Are flexible down payment installment schemes available?</span>
<span class="faq-icon material-symbols-outlined text-property-minimalist-secondary transition-transform duration-300">expand_more</span>
</button>
<div class="faq-answer max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 px-property-minimalist-space-lg">
<p class="font-property-minimalist-body-md text-property-minimalist-body-md text-property-minimalist-on-surface-variant pb-property-minimalist-space-lg">Yes. We offer an interest-free developer installment program for down payments (DP dicicil hingga 12x tanpa bunga). The initial booking fee of IDR 25 Million directly offsets the first down payment tranche, with the remaining equity split equally across 12 consecutive calendar months prior to bank disbursement.</p>
